WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:19.303
Checking out works exactly like checking in.

2
00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:26.142
Search for the attendee who is leaving.

3
00:00:26.142 --> 00:00:31.864
Tap their name.

4
00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:37.788
Check In now shows the time they arrived, and is finished.

5
00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:43.542
Check Out is the one that is ready. Tap it.

6
00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:50.067
Both times are now on today’s record.
